{% if parent_experiment %}
## Parent experiment
- ID: {{ parent_experiment.id }}
- Status: {{ parent_experiment.status }}
- Metrics: {% for k, v in parent_experiment.metrics.items() %}{{ k }}={{ v }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% else %}(none){% endfor %}
{% endif %}

{% if comparison %}
## What changed since the parent run
- Verdict: {{ comparison.verdict.value }} — {{ comparison.verdict_reason }}
- Primary metric: {{ comparison.primary_metric_key or "n/a" }}
- Metric deltas:
{% for key, delta in comparison.metric_deltas.items() %}
  - {{ key }}: {{ "%+.4f"|format(delta) }}
{% else %}
  - (none)
{% endfor %}
- Config changes:
{% for change in comparison.changes %}
  - [{{ change.category.value }}] {{ change.label }}
{% else %}
  - (none)
{% endfor %}
{% elif comparison_failed %}
## What changed since the parent run
Comparison could not be loaded or computed for this child run. Treat this as a degraded
reflection: explain likely failure/root cause and what to fix before resume. Leave
`new_hypotheses` empty.
{% elif parent_experiment %}
## What changed since the parent run
No comparison artifact was available yet. Infer carefully from parent vs current metrics
if present; leave `new_hypotheses` empty if evidence is too thin.
{% endif %}

{% if hypothesis %}
## Hypothesis under test
- ID: {{ hypothesis.id }}
- Status: {{ hypothesis.status.value }}
- Observation: {{ hypothesis.observation }}
- Reason: {{ hypothesis.reason }}
- Prediction: {{ hypothesis.prediction }}
- Confidence: {{ hypothesis.confidence }}
{% if hypothesis.tags %}
- Tags: {{ hypothesis.tags | join(", ") }}
{% endif %}

Only update this hypothesis ID in `hypothesis_updates` if the evidence supports a status change.
{% else %}
## Hypothesis under test
None tagged on this run. Leave `hypothesis_updates` empty.
{% endif %}

